    "description": "An assortment of vintage single and unmatched earrings, ideal for jewelers, crafters, replacement pairs, or upcycling projects. This mixed lot features a variety of stud, drop, clip-on, and screw-back styles showcasing fine metals, designer hallmarks, and varied stone settings.\nHighlights include a sterling silver heart-shaped drop stamped \"REO STERLING\" on the reverse, an earring with a post marked \"14K\", and vintage signed pieces including a Monet clip-on and an Avon component. The collection also contains an array of rhinestone clusters, faux pearl accents, lapis-look and green stone cabochon studs, and gold-tone geometric and drop single earrings.\nMaterials, gold content, and gemstones have not been lab or chemically tested beyond visible stamped hallmarks (such as Sterling and 14K); pieces are described based on visual appearance. Please review all photos closely for individual condition, hallmarks, metal wear, and included pieces. Only items shown are included.",
